program	export_reserved_symbol_error.saw
triple	arm64-apple-darwin
twin	same
expect	error
build	refused	`@export` symbol `saw_thing` collides with a reserved runtime symbol (`main`, `saw_*`, `__saw_*`)
meets_expect	yes
log	"error: `@export` symbol `saw_thing` collides with a reserved runtime symbol (`main`, `saw_*`, `__saw_*`)"
log	"  --> examples/export_reserved_symbol_error.saw:7:1"
log	"    |"
log	" 7 | func t() -> Int { 1 }"
log	"    | ^"
log	"   hint: choose a different exported symbol name via `@export(\"other_name\")`"
log	""
log	"1 error(s) generated"
